<title>USA: Calumet Bancorp to buy back more shares.</title>
<headline>Calumet Bancorp to buy back more shares.</headline>
<dateline>DOLTON, Ill. 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calumet Bancorp Inc said Friday its board of directors authorized it to repurchase an additional 111,000 shares of common stock over the next six months.</p>
<p>As of March 31, it had 2,238,147 shares.  </p>
<p>The latest share repurchase is in addition to an earlier authorization for 118,850 shares of common stock. Under that authorization, which was announced February 3, 101,000 shares have been repurchased, Calumet said.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
